---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Appointment Management API | Miller Arias"
  description="Appointment Management API: Miller Arias' backend project for appointment management, featuring API architecture and data persistence."
>
  <main
    class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-16 md:mt-24"
    transition:name="card-project-appointment"
  >
    <a
      href="/"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-3 text-sm font-mono text-neutral-500 hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors group"
    >
      <span class="inline-block transform group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform">
        ←
      </span>
      Back to home
    </a>

    <header class="mb-12 mt-11">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 text-xs font-mono rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
          Full Stack Enterprise
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 text-neutral-400 text-xs font-mono rounded-full">
          Decoupled Architecture
        </span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-100 mb-6">
        Appointment Management API
      </h1>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Robust clinical appointment scheduling and management system. Designed
        with an enterprise backend featuring strict validation of relational
        schemas and a high-performance modular SPA client.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/Miller1999/Bookly"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono bg-neutral-900 text-neutral-300 hover:text-white border border-neutral-800 hover:border-neutral-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl transition active:scale-[0.99]"
        >
          <span>View Repository on GitHub</span>
          <span class="text-neutral-600">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <hr class="border-neutral-900 my-12" />

    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        Architecture Topology
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-neutral-900/30 border border-neutral-900 rounded-2xl p-6 font-mono text-xs relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-center relative z-10">
          <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-900/60 rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/60 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">
                Presentation Layer
              </span>
              <p class="text-neutral-200 font-bold text-sm">React 18 + Vite</p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] mt-3">
              Typed SPA with TypeScript, Axios for HTTP requests, and Tailwind
              CSS.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-900/60 rounded-xl border border-purple-500/20 flex flex-col justify-between relative">
            <div class="absolute -top-2 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 px-2 py-0.5 bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 text-[9px] uppercase rounded border border-purple-500/30">
              RESTful
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">
                Core Logic
              </span>
              <p class="text-neutral-200 font-bold text-sm">ASP.NET Core 8</p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] mt-3">
              Model-level validation, dependency injection, and asynchronous
              routing.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-900/60 rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/60 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">
                Data Storage
              </span>
              <p class="text-neutral-200 font-bold text-sm">
                PostgreSQL + EF Core
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-neutral-500 text-[11px] mt-3">
              Automated Object-Relational Mapping (ORM) through strict
              migrations.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        API Endpoints (REST API)
      </h2>
      <div class="bg-neutral-900 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="p-4 bg-neutral-950 border-b border-neutral-800 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400">
            Base controller:{" "}
            <code class="text-purple-400">/api/appointments</code>
          </span>
          <span class="text-[10px] bg-neutral-900 px-2 py-0.5 border border-neutral-800 rounded text-neutral-500 font-mono">
            Swagger UI Compliant
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 overflow-x-auto overscroll-x-contain">
          <table class="w-full text-left font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400 min-w-[500px]">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-neutral-800 text-neutral-500">
                <th class="pb-2 font-normal w-24">Method</th>
                <th class="pb-2 font-normal">Endpoint Route</th>
                <th class="pb-2 font-normal">Operation / Impact</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr class="border-b border-neutral-800/50">
                <td class="py-3 font-bold text-emerald-400">GET</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-neutral-200">/api/appointments</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-neutral-500">
                  Full listing with built-in pagination.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-neutral-800/50">
                <td class="py-3 font-bold text-emerald-400">GET</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-neutral-200">/api/appointments/{"id"}</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-neutral-500">
                  Atomic lookup by unique ID in the relational database.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-neutral-800/50">
                <td class="py-3 font-bold text-blue-400">POST</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-neutral-200">/api/appointments</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-neutral-500">
                  Creation and insertion with asynchronous validation.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-neutral-800/50">
                <td class="py-3 font-bold text-amber-400">PUT</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-neutral-200">/api/appointments/{"id"}</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-neutral-500">
                  Full mutation of appointment data and statuses.
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 font-bold text-red-400">DELETE</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-neutral-200">/api/appointments/{"id"}</td>
                <td class="py-3 text-neutral-500">
                  Physical removal of the record via Entity Framework.
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Data Contract (JSON Schema)
      </h2>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        Lifecycle integrity guarantee for the allowed transactional states (
        <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-neutral-300">
          pending
        </code>
        ,{" "}
        <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-neutral-300">
          confirmed
        </code>
        ,{" "}
        <code class="text-xs bg-neutral-900 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-neutral-300">
          cancelled
        </code>
        ).
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="bg-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800">
          <span class="text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase block mb-3">
            // HTTP POST Body
          </span>
          <pre class="text-neutral-300"><code>{"{"}
  <span class="text-purple-400">"clientName"</span>: <span class="text-cyan-400">"John Doe"</span>,
  <span class="text-purple-400">"date"</span>: <span class="text-cyan-400">"2024-12-01T10:00:00"</span>,
  <span class="text-purple-400">"status"</span>: <span class="text-cyan-400">"pending"</span>
{"}"}</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800">
          <span class="text-[10px] text-neutral-500 uppercase block mb-3">
            // HTTP 201 Created Response
          </span>
          <pre class="text-neutral-300"><code>{"{"}
  <span class="text-purple-400">"id"</span>: <span class="text-orange-400">1</span>,
  <span class="text-purple-400">"clientName"</span>: <span class="text-cyan-400">"John Doe"</span>,
  <span class="text-purple-400">"date"</span>: <span class="text-cyan-400">"2024-12-01T10:00:00"</span>,
  <span class="text-purple-400">"status"</span>: <span class="text-cyan-400">"pending"</span>,
  <span class="text-purple-400">"createdAt"</span>: <span class="text-neutral-500">"2024-10-03..."</span>
{"}"}</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        Development Strategy & Quality Control
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-mono text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
            Dual Validation (Client & Server Side)
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Data consistency is protected on every perimeter. The frontend
            intercepts empty strings or invalid dates before consuming the
            network, while the backend executes strict filters using native C#
            <strong>Data Annotations</strong>, preventing corruption or
            malicious payloads from reaching the PostgreSQL database directly.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-mono text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
            Volume Efficiency: Native Pagination
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Instead of saturating the client's RAM by transmitting hundreds of
            records simultaneously, the controller exposes numeric pagination
            parameters that segment the response at the database level thanks to
            deferred filtering directives in{" "}
            <strong>LINQ / Entity Framework Core</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="mt-24 pt-8 border-t border-neutral-800 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500">
        Miller Arias • Technical Project Details • 2026
      </p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>
